  i Without this function, the subscription can't be stopped, so the store keeps calling the callback and keeps it in memory after it's no longer needed.
  
  i Save the returned function and call it when you no longer need the subscription, for example when the component is destroyed.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

